WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
In Genesis, a man and a woman
hear something in a garden,

2
00:00:04.210 --> 00:00:06.000
in the cool of the day.

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:09.690
It is the voice of the LORD
God, walking in the garden.

4
00:00:09.740 --> 00:00:11.090
And they hide.

5
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:14.410
Yet Jews hold that God has no body at all.

6
00:00:14.460 --> 00:00:18.710
So if God has no body, how
can Jews call God King,

7
00:00:18.760 --> 00:00:21.260
Father, or simply You?

8
00:00:21.310 --> 00:00:26.310
In this mission, you'll see how an ancient
translation and Maimonides read a God

9
00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:27.740
who walks.

10
00:00:27.790 --> 00:00:32.690
Then you'll meet Martin Buber, who
described two basic ways of relating.

11
00:00:32.740 --> 00:00:37.520
Your mission: explain how Jews
can call a God with no body King,

12
00:00:37.570 --> 00:00:39.550
Father, or simply You.
